          "docs": "Same as [/hunting_rulesets/{id}/{relationships}](https://gtidocs.virustotal.com/reference/get-hunting-ruleset-full-relationships) except it returns just the related object's descriptor (and context attributes, if any) instead of returning all attributes.\n"
        },
