          "docs": "Hunting Rulesets objects have relationships to other objects. As mentioned in the [Relationships](https://gtidocs.virustotal.com/reference/relationships) section, those related objects can be retrieved by sending `GET` requests to the relationship URL. \n\nThe relationships supported by Hunting Rulesets objects are documented in the [Hunting Rulesets](https://gtidocs.virustotal.com/reference/hunting-ruleset-object#relationships) API object page.\n"
